    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "我是猫。我一岁了。我喜欢吃东西。我也喜欢睡觉。",
      "traditional": "我是貓。我一歲了。我喜歡吃東西。我也喜歡睡覺。",
      "pinyin": "wǒ shì māo wǒ yí suì le wǒ xǐ huan chī dōng xi wǒ yě xǐ huan shuì jiào",
      "english": "I’m a cat. I’m one year old. I like to eat food. I also like to sleep."
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "星期一，我在商店吃饭，我在学校睡觉；",
      "traditional": "星期一，我在商店吃飯，我在學校睡覺；",
      "pinyin": "xīng qī yī wǒ zài shāng diàn chī fàn wǒ zài xué xiào shuì jiào",
      "english": "On Monday, I ate at a store, and I slept at a school."
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "星期二，商店没有饭。我在学校吃饭，我在饭店睡觉；",
      "traditional": "星期二，商店沒有飯。我在學校吃飯，我在飯店睡覺；",
      "pinyin": "xīng qī èr shāng diàn méi yǒu fàn wǒ zài xué xiào chī fàn wǒ zài fàn diàn shuì jiào",
      "english": "On Tuesday, the store didn’t have any food. I ate at the school, and I slept at a restaurant."
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "星期三，商店没有饭，学校也没有饭。",
      "traditional": "星期三，商店沒有飯，學校也沒有飯。",
      "pinyin": "xīng qī sān shāng diàn méi yǒu fàn xué xiào yě méi yǒu fàn",
      "english": "On Wednesday, the store didn’t have any food, and the school didn’t have any food either."
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "我在饭店吃饭，我在医院睡觉；",
      "traditional": "我在飯店吃飯，我在醫院睡覺；",
      "pinyin": "wǒ zài fàn diàn chī fàn wǒ zài yī yuàn shuì jiào",
      "english": "I ate at the restaurant, and I slept at a hospital."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "星期四，我在医院吃饭，我在商店睡觉……",
      "traditional": "星期四，我在醫院吃飯，我在商店睡覺……",
      "pinyin": "xīng qī sì wǒ zài yī yuàn chī fàn wǒ zài shāng diàn shuì jiào",
      "english": "On Thursday, I ate at the hospital, and I slept at the store …"
    },
    {
