      "pinyin": "",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "有时候，商店、学校、饭店和医院都没有饭。我不能吃饭。",
      "traditional": "有時候，商店、學校、飯店和醫院都沒有飯。我不能吃飯。",
      "pinyin": "yǒu shí hou shāng diàn xué xiào fàn diàn hé yī yuàn dōu méi yǒu fàn wǒ bù néng chī fàn",
      "english": "Sometimes, there’s no food at the store, school, restaurant, or hospital. I can’t eat."
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "我没有爸爸，也没有妈妈。",
      "traditional": "我沒有爸爸，也沒有媽媽。",
      "pinyin": "wǒ méi yǒu bà ba yě méi yǒu mā ma",
      "english": "I don’t have a dad, and I also don’t have a mom."
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "simplified": "我是猫。我一岁了！我很想：",
      "traditional": "我是貓。我一歲了！我很想：",
      "pinyin": "wǒ shì māo wǒ yí suì le wǒ hěn xiǎng",
      "english": "I’m a cat. I’m one year old! I really wish:"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "simplified": "星期一、星期二、星期三、星期四、星期五、星期六和星期天，都能吃饭！",
      "traditional": "星期一、星期二、星期三、星期四、星期五、星期六和星期天，都能吃飯！",
      "pinyin": "xīng qī yī xīng qī èr xīng qī sān xīng qī sì xīng qī wǔ xīng qī liù hé xīng qī tiān dōu néng chī fàn",
      "english": "I can eat on Mondays, Tuesdays, Wednesdays, Thursdays, Fridays, Saturdays, and Sundays!"
    },
    {
